    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "In my opinion, it is necessary for everyone to have his or her own "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "unique",
            "ref": "v-unique"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " skill. I am very fond of baking cakes. "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b1",
            "number": 1
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". So, I picked up this skill to help myself relax."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "At a young age, I often watched people bake cakes on TV. Their cakes looked so nice and delicious that I could almost smell and taste them through the screen. "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b2",
            "number": 2
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". From then on, I began to learn this skill from my mum. With her encouragement and my "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "continuous",
            "ref": "v-continuous"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " trying, my skill at baking cakes has been getting better and better."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Once, I was trying to "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "decorate",
            "ref": "v-decorate"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " a cake by myself for my sister’s birthday. I tried my best. However, I still couldn’t do it well. My hands shook when I started drawing on the cake. My mum told me that I was too nervous. “Just try doing it. "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b3",
            "number": 3
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ",” she told me. “Also, it shows your sister that you care for her.” At the birthday party, my sister and I had a good time and she said that my cake was beautiful and delicious. It was then that I understood sharing with others gives us happiness."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Now, I’m able to bake different kinds of cakes. It’s my unique cakes. "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b4",
            "number": 4
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". Most importantly, baking cakes allows me to feel the happiness of being active, and it enriches my life. Therefore, I am trying to make my cakes tastier and more attractive."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p5",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "As the saying goes, “If a thing is worth doing, it is worth doing well.” The same goes for baking. "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b5",
            "number": 5
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". Baking is my unique skill. What’s yours?"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  "sections": [
    {
      "id": "s1",
      "instruction": "Fill in each blank in the article with a proper sentence given below. Each sentence can be used only once. Note that there are two more sentences than you will need.",
      "bank": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "content": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "I feel as free as a bird while baking"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "content": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "I hope to open my own cake shop one day"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "content": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "My favourite cake to bake is a rich chocolate cake"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "content": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "A skill is not only useful, but also enriches our lives"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "E",
          "content": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "Even if you can’t do it very well, it’s fine as long as you have done your best"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "F",
          "content": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "It was then that I discovered how interesting and relaxing it is to bake cakes"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "G",
          "content": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "Not only can I eat yummy cakes, but I can also have the great joy of sharing them"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
